content.text:
The degradation traces back to one fault: `ts-train-service` failing its database calls. Its effect reaches the user through the basic, travel and route-plan services.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-train-service",
      "fault_kind": "database_call_failed",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_status_code, count(*) AS n, round(min(duration)/1e6,1) AS min_ms, round(max(duration)/1e6,1) AS max_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-train-service' AND attr_span_kind='Internal' AND span_name LIKE 'SELECT%' GROUP BY 1,2 ORDER BY 1,2",
          "claim": "All train-service SELECT DB spans in the incident end in Error after almost exactly 30 s, the connection-acquisition timeout."
        },
